# Fixtures are binary artifacts: a byte inside them is a byte of the document, not a
# line ending. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites every PDF git sniffs as text on a
# Windows checkout, and the byte-level assertions in src/lib/attachments.fixture.test.ts and
# src/lib/edge-cases.test.ts then read a document nobody generated.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
